{title: THE LION SLEEPS TONIGHT}
{categories: internazionali}

[SOL]In the jungle, the [DO]mighty jungle,
th[SOL]e lion sleeps to[RE]night.
I[SOL]n the village, the [DO]peaceful village,
the peop[SOL]le sleep tonight[RE].

[SOL]Aweem away, aweem away,
